Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): /search/results in the Stitch 2026-11 design
 (Desktop/02, Mobile/02)

Sticky filter card, summary card, Stitch flight card (carrier badge, big times, dashed route, stop pill),
dark-red full-width CTA. Presentation only: data, prices (login-gated), booking logic unchanged.
QA with a local Mock API (labelled Mock): qa/impl/flight-results-*-mock.png.

